      "message": "Jakub, could you please use LeAudioLtvMap for the metadata as well like codec_spec_caps, instead of using std::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e\n\nBecasue as per the spec recommendation metadata should be in LTV formatt. \n\nIn this way LTV formatt metadata used across all layesr of the stack.",
